  "solution": {
    "text": "The entropy is the measure of disorder or randomness in a system. When a system changes from one state to another, the change of entropy, $d S$ is given by\r\n$$\r\nd S=\\frac{\\delta q_{\\mathrm{rev}}}{T}\r\n$$",
